# Observations. The log itself is not carried in git: one census is ~300 MB and
# git never forgets, so a week of them would exceed what GitHub is willing to
# hold. Signed tree heads -- a few hundred bytes a day -- will live in heads/
# once the Merkle log exists, and git's refusal to forget becomes the point.
data/

# Build output
*.exe
dist/

# Editor
.vscode/
